# In the Name of Science (otherAreas 76): Yurim (Tavnazian Safehold; his DefaultActions 527 alternates with his script:
# each script talk follows a default talk, and a script talk that plays nothing plays the default instead). A WAR 75.
# The Warriors' Path current (not completed: CoP completion is a mission below the current one): no arm. A base traded
# while available: nothing. Emptiness Bleeds current (a GM; The Warriors' Path completed): 524, begun (no option read).
# Accepted, no target: 525. A pie alone: nothing. A pie with the Karin Obi base: 526 (Silver Obi, Red Chip), the target
# 15435; the pie is taken too (the pie arm's tradeHas confirms it before its target test fails). A target: 532 or 528
# (the draw; the base). A base again with a target: nothing. The pie: 531 (pie, 0, 1). The organs with a pie (the organ
# arm first): 529 (Gorget, Silver Earring, Silver Obi); a full bag: giveItem false (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED, the Karin
# Obi), nothing else; one free slot (the bag one larger: the test is < 1): the Karin Obi, the target 0, completed, the
# organs taken (the pie kept). Completed, no target: 525. The base again: 526; the organs: 529; the Karin Obi held (rare):
# giveItem false, not completed again, the target kept, the organs kept. Completed with a target: 532 or 528.
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=82.5,-25.0,3.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
item SilverObi
item SilverObi
item RedChip
item RedChip
item ApplePie x4
item PhuaboOrgan x12
item XzomitOrgan x6
item SampleOfLuminianTissue x6
login
trigger Yurim                           # UseFallback 0: the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # the script: The Warriors' Path current: no arm: the default 527
finish
trade Yurim SilverObi x1 RedChip x1     # available, no target: nothing (accepted or completed wanted)
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath completed   # a GM (no current mission: addMission warns over a current one)
mission Cop EmptinessBleeds current     # a GM: The Warriors' Path completed
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # available: 524 (Silver Obi, Silver Earring, Gorget)
finish option=1                         # begun (no option read)
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # accepted, no target: 525 (Silver Obi, Silver Earring, Gorget)
finish
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # accepted, no target, no base: nothing
trade Yurim ApplePie x1 SilverObi x1 RedChip x1   # the Karin Obi base: target 15435; 526 (Silver Obi, Red Chip)
finish                                  # the Silver Obi, the Red Chip and the pie taken
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Obi, Red Chip)
finish
trade Yurim SilverObi x1 RedChip x1     # a target, no pie, not its organs: nothing
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # accepted, a target: 531 (Apple Pie, 0, 1)
finish                                  # the pie taken
fill-inventory
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x7 XzomitOrgan x3 SampleOfLuminianTissue x3 ApplePie x1   # the organs: 529
finish                                  # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (Karin Obi); nothing else
storage inventory 31                    # one free slot
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x7 XzomitOrgan x3 SampleOfLuminianTissue x3 ApplePie x1   # 529
finish option=1                         # the Karin Obi; the target 0; completed; the organs taken, the pie kept
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # completed, no target: 525
finish
trade Yurim SilverObi x1 RedChip x1     # completed, no target: the Karin Obi base again: 526
finish                                  # both taken
item PhuaboOrgan x2                     # a GM: 7 Phuabo again
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x7 XzomitOrgan x3 SampleOfLuminianTissue x3   # 529
finish                                  # the Karin Obi held (rare): ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED; the target kept; kept
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # completed, a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Obi, Red Chip)
finish
